---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(281) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Pool Repair in Spring, TX | Crack, Tile & Surface Fixes" description="Professional pool repair in Spring, TX. Crack repair, tile work, surface assessment, and honest recommendations. Licensed technicians.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Pool Repair</h1>
      <p>Structural and surface repairs that protect your investment and keep water where it belongs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>From hairline cracks to loose tile and aging surfaces, we diagnose and repair common pool issues found in Spring homes. We explain options clearly and only recommend work that is needed.</p>
      <h2>Common Repairs</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Crack and leak sealing</li>
        <li>Tile and coping repair or replacement</li>
        <li>Surface assessment (plaster, pebble, vinyl)</li>
        <li>Fitting and return jet replacement</li>
        <li>Honest guidance on repair vs. resurfacing</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Our Approach</h2>
      <p>We start with a thorough inspection, show you the findings, and provide a written estimate before any work begins. No upsells—just practical solutions for Texas pools.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Request a Repair Quote</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
